"""eHub Closed Won dashboard generator (ehub-dashboard-daily-v2).

Usage:
  python3 ehub-dashboard-generator.py [--data DIR] [--out FILE] [--today YYYY-MM-DD]

--data DIR : folder with fresh query results (q1a/q1b/q1c/q1force/q2/q3/q4/q5/q6/qN .json,
             compact row format documented below). If omitted, the QUERY_DATA snapshot embedded
             at the bottom of this file (from the last run) is used.
Row formats:
  q1*.json  : [Id, Name, CloseDate, Total_ACV_Value__c, CurrencyIsoCode, Account.Name,
               Top_Parent_Account__r.Name, Owner.Name, Sales_Region__c, Opportunity_Agent_Count__c,
               Expected_Go_Live__c, PM_Go_Live_Date__c, PM_Estimated_Go_Live__c, Contract_Type__c,
               NICE_OM_Booked__c, TimetoTurnUp__c]
  q2.json   : [Opportunity__c, Status__c, PSActualGoLive__c, PSEstimatedGoLive__c, Estimated_Project_End__c]
  q3/q4/qN  : [OpportunityId, ...]
  q5/q6     : [[OpportunityId, ProductCode], ...]
"""
